WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
Sign: I'll find them - my comrades!

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000
21:00

00:09.060 --> 00:10.470
What happened?

00:11.200 --> 00:12.690
I can't see anything...

00:12.690 --> 00:14.360
What happened to everyone?

00:14.360 --> 00:15.360
Where'd those guys go?

00:16.610 --> 00:18.040
<i>My right shoulder is burning!</i>

00:18.040 --> 00:21.160
<i>That's right, it got hit!</i>

00:21.160 --> 00:22.230
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:22.230 --> 00:24.360
<i>At this rate, he'll get everyone!</i>

00:24.360 --> 00:27.100
<i>Makie-san, Yuuna-san and the others are here too!</i>

00:27.100 --> 00:28.540
Setsuna-san!

00:28.540 --> 00:29.670
Asuna-san!

00:30.900 --> 00:31.980
Ah! Setsuna-san!

00:33.150 --> 00:33.850
<i>Stone?</i>

00:34.930 --> 00:36.800
<i>It can't be... Eternal Petrification?!</i>

00:37.890 --> 00:38.510
Nodoka-san!

00:45.440 --> 00:46.810
<i>Even Makie-san!</i>

00:47.190 --> 00:49.060
No way... why?!

00:50.840 --> 00:52.820
Because you weren't strong enough.

00:54.050 --> 00:58.210
With that half-assed power of yours, you got innocent people involved.

00:58.210 --> 01:01.090
And all because you want to find your father?

01:02.150 --> 01:03.370
I'm flabbergasted.

01:05.070 --> 01:09.210
You should've just stayed at that Academy, enjoying the peaceful times.

01:11.380 --> 01:14.720
Why did you come here, Negi-kun?

03:02.690 --> 03:03.910
Huh? Where is this?

03:05.780 --> 03:09.200
Is this a forest? A jungle?

03:09.200 --> 03:12.000
That was some scary nightmare.

03:12.000 --> 03:14.340
My head still feels dizzy.

03:30.190 --> 03:31.180
Negi-sensei.

03:31.180 --> 03:32.560
Chachamaru-san.

03:33.530 --> 03:35.440
You shouldn't be moving yet!

03:36.610 --> 03:39.590
Are you alright? How is your wound?

03:42.140 --> 03:43.610
Just as I thought. You have a fever.

03:43.610 --> 03:45.040
38.3 degrees Celsius.

03:45.040 --> 03:47.660
W-Wait, Chachamaru!

03:47.660 --> 03:49.410
Put on some clothes first!

03:49.840 --> 03:51.400
Why are you naked anyway?!

03:51.400 --> 03:55.540
My new body is washable in water, so I was just taking a bath.

03:55.540 --> 03:57.290
Just put on some clothes first!

03:58.620 --> 03:59.550
Why?

03:59.550 --> 04:01.890
Just do it!

04:02.720 --> 04:05.680
No, your condition is more important than me.

04:06.040 --> 04:09.020
You were hit in the chest by a stone spear.

04:09.020 --> 04:14.100
While it is a Complete Recovery spell, it isn't perfect; you still need to rest.

04:15.240 --> 04:15.850
My chest?

04:17.190 --> 04:17.980
Yes.

04:21.190 --> 04:23.870
That's right! What happened after that?!

04:23.870 --> 04:24.780
Where'd those guys go?!

04:24.780 --> 04:26.070
Is everyone alright?!

04:26.490 --> 04:29.200
9 hours and 57 minutes have passed since then.

04:29.200 --> 04:33.780
Fate Averruncus and 4 others escaped using a Transportation spell.

04:33.780 --> 04:42.340
Members of "Ala Alba" and others there appear to have been scattered by a Forced Teleportation spell.

04:42.690 --> 04:44.130
Their whereabouts are unknown.

04:44.130 --> 04:46.930
Scattered... That can't be...

04:47.590 --> 04:50.390
Fate Averruncus...

04:51.870 --> 04:55.640
Half-assed power is so unsightly...

04:55.970 --> 04:58.400
Don't you think so, Negi?

05:05.550 --> 05:09.200
Asuna-san, can you hear me? Answer me if you can hear me!

05:10.800 --> 05:11.700
It's no good.

05:11.700 --> 05:13.120
Negi-sensei.

05:13.700 --> 05:16.120
Negi-sensei, you shouldn't be moving.

05:21.170 --> 05:24.870
Chachamaru-san, how far were we teleported?

05:25.090 --> 05:28.380
How far apart was everyone separated?

05:28.590 --> 05:31.890
At least a thousand kilometers.

05:32.610 --> 05:33.520
That far?!

05:33.520 --> 05:34.750
That's right.

05:35.380 --> 05:37.080
Negi-sensei, the badge!

05:37.080 --> 05:37.710
Eh?

05:37.710 --> 05:39.520
The Ala Alba badge!

05:40.960 --> 05:43.550
This badge contains many features,

05:43.550 --> 05:45.730
one of which is to determine the location of other badges.

05:50.250 --> 05:51.140
Signal detected.

05:51.140 --> 05:56.100
Two to the Northwest - one at 100 km, another at 180 km.

05:56.100 --> 06:01.940
There's one more 540 km East North East, but that doesn't account for them all.

06:01.940 --> 06:05.930
That may be because they're beyond the 1800 km range of detection.

06:07.300 --> 06:09.550
This is my present to you.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.680
So this is what he meant...

06:12.000 --> 06:13.680
Bringing up a World Map.

06:14.170 --> 06:17.810
Sensei, we may be able to determine the location of ourselves and everyone else.

06:18.360 --> 06:23.950
Negi-sensei, this world is only about one third of Earth,

06:23.950 --> 06:27.690
but even so, Mundus Magicus is huge.

06:28.420 --> 06:32.120
In order for everyone to return to Mahora Academy safely,

06:32.120 --> 06:36.870
we will have to search this vast world for our comrades.

06:44.310 --> 06:46.640
I'll be going then, Master.

06:46.640 --> 06:48.720
Yeah, hurry up and go.

06:49.010 --> 06:53.890
Master, you were talking to Negi-sensei until very late last night.

06:54.180 --> 06:58.940
He's still inexperienced in the extreme so there were lots of details to explain.

06:58.940 --> 07:00.160
I see.

07:00.160 --> 07:02.510
I just noticed that when you came to sending him off,

07:04.110 --> 07:09.810
ou er ackin oo wowwied aa- {"you were acting all worried that-"}

07:09.990 --> 07:13.320
Since when could you talk to me like that?!

07:13.640 --> 07:15.440
<i>Ooh! Soft!</i>

07:15.440 --> 07:17.310
<i>Good job, Hakase!</i>

07:20.610 --> 07:22.570
And what about you?

07:23.130 --> 07:26.920
You've been so worried about that bouya so much lately that you're pathetic.

07:29.770 --> 07:31.930
That's not truuuuuuu-

07:31.930 --> 07:35.800
Don't! You mustn't screw me so haa-

07:36.430 --> 07:38.430
I'll screw you! I'll screw you! {was: I'm turning it! I'm turning it!}

07:38.860 --> 07:41.450
<i>Looks like a fight between elementary school kids.</i>

07:41.450 --> 07:44.360
Anyway, look after him.

07:45.920 --> 07:48.900
It'll be boring for me if he disappears.

07:49.970 --> 07:55.030
Even without me ordering you to, you'd probably protect him anyway.

07:57.490 --> 08:01.160
Well, be honest with your feelings on this trip.

08:02.890 --> 08:03.930
Master...

08:03.930 --> 08:05.260
Chachamaru-san?

08:05.260 --> 08:06.380
Chachamaru-san?

08:06.380 --> 08:07.710
Chachamaru-san?

08:08.220 --> 08:09.930
I figured out where we are!

08:10.530 --> 08:11.340
O-Okay.

08:11.710 --> 08:14.630
Let's try and compare everyone's positions.

08:14.630 --> 08:15.080
Yes!

08:17.570 --> 08:22.320
<i>In any case, I doubt you'll run into much trouble this time.</i>

08:22.970 --> 08:24.690
<i>So enjoy yourself at least.</i>

08:25.140 --> 08:27.970
<i>You were wrong, Master. What should I do?</i>

08:28.510 --> 08:31.510
<i>It looks like we did run into trouble.</i>

08:34.160 --> 08:36.490
This is a map of the entire "Mundus Magicus".

08:36.720 --> 08:39.820
Wow, this is the map of the world...

08:40.600 --> 08:42.500
It really is a "different world"!

08:42.880 --> 08:47.760
Fortunately, a number of people were scattered relatively close.

08:47.760 --> 08:50.160
We can't tell who they are though, right?

08:50.160 --> 08:51.240
Unfortunately not.

08:52.740 --> 08:54.840
Let's go, Chachamaru-san.

08:55.090 --> 08:56.720
We can't. Your condition...

08:56.720 --> 08:59.460
The safety of everyone else is more important than my safety!

09:03.030 --> 09:04.830
You're pushing yourself too much.

09:04.830 --> 09:06.680
Please rest until morning.

09:07.630 --> 09:09.350
D-Damn it.

09:16.470 --> 09:17.530
Alright, it's morning.

09:17.940 --> 09:18.410
Let's go!

09:18.800 --> 09:19.390
Yes.

09:22.050 --> 09:23.960
We won't last long if we hurry so much!

10:00.940 --> 10:03.220
Sensei, let's rest here.

10:03.220 --> 10:04.950
You don't look so well.

10:04.950 --> 10:06.550
Eh? We can't!

10:06.550 --> 10:09.540
We have to reach the first person's location by sunset!

10:09.910 --> 10:12.530
It'll all come to naught if you collapse.

10:18.360 --> 10:19.880
Eh! Tige- Dragon?!

10:20.260 --> 10:21.390
Negi-sensei...

10:25.100 --> 10:26.190
Magic Arrows! {Translation}

10:25.100 --> 10:26.190
Sagitta Magica! {Latin}

10:26.390 --> 10:27.890
Three Arrows of Light! {Translation}

10:26.390 --> 10:27.890
Series Lucis! {Latin}

10:31.260 --> 10:32.110
He deflected it?!

10:32.320 --> 10:33.610
A wild beast did?!

10:39.550 --> 10:40.410
Negi-sensei!

10:47.270 --> 10:48.250
Chachamaru-san!

10:48.250 --> 10:49.750
Otherworldly beast...

10:49.750 --> 10:51.780
I won't forgive you...

10:54.680 --> 10:56.830
for laying your paws on Negi-sensei!

11:19.000 --> 11:21.660
Thank goodness... you've regained consciousness...

11:26.670 --> 11:27.970
I'm so sorry!

11:28.240 --> 11:30.040
Huh? Where's the beast?

11:30.170 --> 11:32.140
I managed to drive it off somehow.

11:32.290 --> 11:33.700
It was strong.

11:34.830 --> 11:36.290
I see.

11:37.220 --> 11:38.510
Chachamaru-san!

11:38.510 --> 11:40.170
You're all worn-out!

11:40.170 --> 11:44.050
No... More importantly, your condition...

11:47.300 --> 11:48.180
Chachamaru-san?!

11:52.490 --> 11:56.860
I-It's alright. I just used a bit too much energy.

11:56.940 --> 11:58.980
Oh no! What should we do?!

11:59.980 --> 12:08.120
Actually, I need someone to turn this once a day...

12:08.950 --> 12:10.080
A coil?

12:12.080 --> 12:15.340
I just need to put it in here and feed Magic in while turning it, right?

12:15.340 --> 12:18.650
Um... I think I'm fine after all, so...

12:18.650 --> 12:20.580
After we meet up with someone else, I can ask them to...

12:20.580 --> 12:21.660
You can't!

12:21.660 --> 12:23.510
You collapsed saving me!

12:23.510 --> 12:26.850
T-Then... be as gentle as possible...

12:27.160 --> 12:28.720
Okay, I'm putting it in.

12:34.280 --> 12:36.100
<i>My voice slipped out!</i>

12:37.440 --> 12:39.940
Um... as slowly as you can...

12:40.220 --> 12:42.320
Okay. Slowly, right?

12:43.330 --> 12:45.300
Less Magic!

12:45.300 --> 12:46.720
Is it painful?

12:46.720 --> 12:48.570
No, that's not it.

12:48.700 --> 12:52.750
Um... this is a ritual to recharge Magic...

12:52.750 --> 12:58.590
So, like the Pactio, it... feels good.

12:59.310 --> 13:00.710
Feels... good?

13:01.380 --> 13:03.200
Then that's fine!

13:05.840 --> 13:08.720
Am I not as good as Master?

13:09.430 --> 13:12.570
N-No! In fact you're incredibly good!

13:12.570 --> 13:16.480
The problem is trying to say which of you is better.

13:16.740 --> 13:18.480
I see... That's good.

13:18.910 --> 13:22.770
I'll keep screwing you until you feel better!

13:24.180 --> 13:26.130
It's becoming kinda fun!

13:26.130 --> 13:27.740
<i>Save me, Master!</i>

13:31.360 --> 13:35.220
<i>Master, Chao... Is this alright?</i>

13:35.220 --> 13:41.460
<i>I feel as though I'm rushing headlong in completely the wrong direction in an illusion.</i>

13:41.700 --> 13:44.340
Chachamaru-san, thank you very much.

13:44.460 --> 13:49.220
If you hadn't saved me earlier, I would've been in big trouble.

13:49.850 --> 13:51.110
At the Gate Port too.

13:51.820 --> 13:55.730
I guess I really am a useless child without everyone.

13:56.330 --> 14:00.930
Everyone... I... um... everyone...

14:05.690 --> 14:08.260
It's alright, Negi-sensei.

14:09.230 --> 14:10.990
I'm sure everyone is alright.

14:16.420 --> 14:20.170
We'll definitely save our comrades.

14:22.290 --> 14:25.250
Starting tomorrow, I'll wind you up every day!

14:25.680 --> 14:26.710
You'll...

14:35.300 --> 14:37.050
Damn it!

14:37.520 --> 14:40.350
As for me, hehe...

14:40.470 --> 14:44.270
Chiu-tan is actually in a lot of trouble-pyon~

14:46.400 --> 14:49.990
On a whim, I decided to join my friends on an overseas trip...

14:50.150 --> 14:56.060
And somehow, I've ended up in the middle of a jungle!

15:01.540 --> 15:04.140
What is this...?

15:04.540 --> 15:07.550
Damn it! What the hell is this?!

15:07.740 --> 15:10.960
WHERE THE HELL AM I?!

15:13.110 --> 15:15.910
It's true, I kid you not! {was:I'm not dreaming!}

15:15.910 --> 15:18.180
I'll up some photos!

15:18.470 --> 15:22.690
Do you believe me? Probably not.

15:22.930 --> 15:24.740
I thought I'd do something different for a change

15:24.740 --> 15:28.190
and hang out with my real friends, but I'm out of luck.

15:29.380 --> 15:32.410
Today's moral: "Don't do things you're not used to".

15:34.830 --> 15:37.370
I don't care how, someone just save me!

15:37.360 --> 15:41.090
Chiu-sama, we can't get any signal here...

15:41.170 --> 15:45.330
I know that even without you electronic sprites telling me!

15:45.330 --> 15:48.500
If I don't do this, my mental stability is in serious danger. {was: I just can't calm down!}

15:48.630 --> 15:51.050
Chiu-tama, you're wasting the battery.

15:51.050 --> 15:52.420
It's escapism...

15:52.420 --> 15:52.880
Yeah...

15:54.930 --> 15:58.970
If the stars don't come out when it becomes night, we can't calculate our position, right?

15:58.970 --> 16:00.260
So leave me alone!

16:04.980 --> 16:05.980
Negi-sensei!

16:20.400 --> 16:21.200
Chisame-san!

16:21.230 --> 16:23.200
Oi! Chachamaru-san!

16:28.320 --> 16:30.590
I'm sorry! I'll definitely save you!

16:30.590 --> 16:33.840
You idiot!

16:36.640 --> 16:40.850
That damn robot... she chose to save that brat instead.

16:40.850 --> 16:41.770
I'll remember that!

16:45.110 --> 16:46.570
What?!

16:47.160 --> 16:50.920
The nearest human civilization is 310 km away?!

16:50.920 --> 16:51.990
Are you kidding?!

16:52.110 --> 16:54.460
Chiu-tama, unfortunately... {was: We're sorry, Chiu-tama.}

16:54.460 --> 16:57.700
No matter how many times we check it, it's the same.

16:57.700 --> 17:00.370
This is a grave fact, or rather, reality. {was: Rather than just a grave fact, this is reality.} {Not too sure about the phrasing here. -Southrop}

17:13.640 --> 17:16.050
I wouldn't have dreamed that this would become a reality...

17:16.420 --> 17:22.540
If I hadn't decided to come along, I'd be surfing the 'net in an air-conditioned room.

17:24.660 --> 17:28.070
No matter how you look at it, that's my reality. {was: that's how my life should be, right?}

17:28.070 --> 17:29.980
Right? Konnya? Negi?

17:30.430 --> 17:32.360
Chi-Chiu-tama...

17:33.160 --> 17:35.450
Hm? What's wrong, Konnya? You're not well.

17:35.450 --> 17:38.920
We electronic sprites can't materialize if we aren't near any working electronics.

17:38.920 --> 17:42.330
Your notebook and phone batteries are probably dying.

17:42.410 --> 17:43.120
What?!

17:44.290 --> 17:45.250
You're right!

17:45.250 --> 17:48.020
Wait, are you guys going to disappear on me?!

17:48.020 --> 17:48.860
Yes...

17:48.860 --> 17:52.000
Sorry for being so useless, Chiu-sama.

17:52.120 --> 17:56.510
Best I can do is use the last of my power to show you the direction of the town.

17:56.760 --> 17:59.010
Hey! Don't push yourself, Negi!

17:59.810 --> 18:00.680
H-Here...

18:03.930 --> 18:05.960
I can't use this?!

18:06.340 --> 18:08.940
Ahh, if you move it, the direction will be wrong!

18:09.320 --> 18:11.460
Don't die, Chiu-sama!

18:12.530 --> 18:14.580
Don't say such morbid stuff!

18:14.580 --> 18:17.290
Ah! Hey! Hang in there, Negi!

18:17.290 --> 18:18.200
Ne...!

18:24.560 --> 18:27.160
It just means I have no one to talk to now.

18:30.920 --> 18:34.570
I-I need to find a safe place to sleep...

18:41.100 --> 18:43.740
If something happens, you'll protect me, right?

18:43.740 --> 18:45.720
Y-Yes! Of course!

18:45.980 --> 18:48.400
And you said you'd protect me!

18:48.400 --> 18:49.810
That idiot!

18:51.970 --> 18:54.780
Who needs your help anyway?!

18:54.940 --> 18:58.190
D-Don't underestimate Hasegawa Chisame-sama!

18:58.200 --> 19:00.610
Screw you, idiot!

19:00.820 --> 19:03.610
I, Hasegawa Chisame-sama, don't need your help!

19:03.610 --> 19:06.370
I'll make it back to the Academy with my own strength!

19:06.370 --> 19:07.610
That brat...

19:07.610 --> 19:11.620
Don't come crying to me next time I see you. I'll tear you up!

19:20.790 --> 19:22.550
(Looks tasty)

19:30.810 --> 19:32.500
(Itadakima~) {Script says the monster says this. I can hear it, but do we want to include this? -Southrop, conman: I hear it but not clearly}

19:32.910 --> 19:34.310
Wait a second!

19:36.820 --> 19:39.970
What kind of B-grade fantasy development is this?!

19:40.390 --> 19:41.610
You bastard!

19:44.200 --> 19:47.700
He's dissolving my clothes so he can savor his meal?

19:48.560 --> 19:51.160
<i>Not only is my life in danger, I'm in danger of perversion?!</i>

19:51.300 --> 19:52.710
He-! Wai-!

19:55.020 --> 19:59.230
The Great Chiu-sama isn't gonna lose to some octopus' pathetic tactics...

19:59.700 --> 20:01.300
Ah! No! Not there...!

20:01.960 --> 20:03.680
I've got to escape somehow...

20:07.400 --> 20:09.640
Don't lick me in weird places!

20:09.640 --> 20:10.660
<i>It's no good!</i>

20:10.660 --> 20:13.690
<i>A fantasy power is needed to defeat a fantasy creature!</i>

20:14.640 --> 20:18.570
<i>Am I really gonna get eaten? By some B-grade monster?!</i>

20:20.260 --> 20:23.530
<i>In a jungle on some non-sensical parallel universe?</i>

20:23.700 --> 20:26.450
<i>Am I really gonna die here?</i>

20:26.570 --> 20:28.260
<i>Without anyone knowing?</i>

20:28.260 --> 20:30.790
<i>Shit, this is seriously bad...</i>

20:32.170 --> 20:33.380
<i>Save me...</i>

20:33.920 --> 20:37.290
SAVE ME, NEGI-SENSEI!!!!

20:41.520 --> 20:42.410
Chacha...!

20:54.580 --> 20:58.480
It's alright, Negi-sensei, the target has fled.

20:58.480 --> 20:59.690
The situation is clear.

21:01.690 --> 21:04.200
So you finally showed up, Fantasy...

21:04.200 --> 21:05.300
Chisame-san...

21:05.300 --> 21:07.580
I'm so glad you're alright! Really!

21:08.950 --> 21:11.130
Huh? Chisame-san?

21:13.840 --> 21:15.670
Shut up!

21:16.490 --> 21:18.580
Ch-Chisame-sa-?

21:25.260 --> 21:26.520
You're late!

21:26.960 --> 21:28.220
I'm so sorry!

21:28.220 --> 21:29.930
It's as you say, Chisame-san, but...

21:30.400 --> 21:33.430
Negi-sensei really pushed himself to get here as quickly as possible.

21:34.240 --> 21:35.810
Chachamaru! You too!

21:35.810 --> 21:37.780
You chose to save that brat instead of me!

21:37.780 --> 21:40.060
That was the decision I made based on the situation.

21:40.060 --> 21:42.240
Sensei was hurt and he couldn't be left alo-

21:42.240 --> 21:45.280
I don't care! Get out of here, you two!

21:45.280 --> 21:46.830
Calm down for a moment...

21:46.830 --> 21:48.620
U-Um... Chisame-san...

21:48.620 --> 21:50.280
Your... robe...

21:50.280 --> 21:50.910
Huh?

21:51.000 --> 21:52.410
Y-You're... naked!

21:53.290 --> 21:55.160
WHA-?! SHUT UP, YOU BRAT!

21:56.750 --> 21:59.200
You just wanted to go off alone with him, didn't you?!

21:59.200 --> 21:59.890
Huh?

22:03.290 --> 22:06.840
10,000 kilometers to Megalomesembria?!

22:07.030 --> 22:09.090
How far is 10,000 km?!

22:09.090 --> 22:12.080
This isn't "3,000 Leagues in Search of Mother"!

22:12.380 --> 22:18.100
Isn't it impossible for us to get back to the Academy in the remaining 15 days of vacation?!

22:19.380 --> 22:21.250
We won't make it back in time for the second term!

22:21.250 --> 22:23.070
We don't know if the students are alright!

22:23.070 --> 22:26.160
Heck, we don't even know if we'll be able to return!

22:26.160 --> 22:33.110
Now then, how is our leader, the prodigy child-teacher, going to take responsibility for this?!

22:33.400 --> 22:36.450
Yes... I'm fully aware that this is all my responsibility...

22:36.450 --> 22:38.490
Well, it's fine as long as you understand.

22:39.800 --> 22:42.630
No, it's not fine.

22:44.900 --> 22:51.590
At this moment, someone else could be in danger, like you were.

22:53.830 --> 22:57.390
It's all... my responsibility... All my...

23:01.500 --> 23:02.390
Hey, what's wrong?!

23:02.390 --> 23:03.320
Negi-sensei?!

23:08.120 --> 23:08.740
Upsie daisy.

23:10.260 --> 23:13.010
I'm really sorry... Chisame-san...

23:13.010 --> 23:18.230
It's all my fault that you... that everyone got wrapped up in this mess...

23:18.230 --> 23:20.650
No, I got carried away earlier.

23:20.650 --> 23:25.360
It wasn't your fault that we ran into that Fate idiot.

23:25.680 --> 23:28.010
No, if it were Master...

23:28.790 --> 23:29.630
Or even Father...

23:29.630 --> 23:31.400
They would have been able to do something about it...

23:31.400 --> 23:33.430
Ah! Hey, are you alright?!

23:37.780 --> 23:41.680
Even though I trained so hard to get the power to defeat him...

23:42.040 --> 23:43.960
Fate Averruncus!

23:43.960 --> 23:47.560
If I can't even defeat someone like him, I'll never reach Father!

23:48.740 --> 23:52.500
Power... That's right... If I had power...

23:53.010 --> 23:54.070
If only I had power...

23:54.850 --> 23:55.830
If only I just had power!

23:56.080 --> 23:57.830
Next time I'll beat him!

23:58.860 --> 24:00.550
I want to become stronger!

24:01.500 --> 24:03.540
Just calm down, Negi-sensei.

24:03.830 --> 24:06.160
You need to take care of yourself first.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.630
It doesn't matter what happens to me...

24:08.130 --> 24:09.000
That's right...

24:09.000 --> 24:13.010
There's still one more person in the jungle, waiting to be saved!

24:13.270 --> 24:15.390
That person is right here.

24:16.610 --> 24:17.860
Eh? Kota...?

24:17.860 --> 24:19.890
Hahaha, you...

24:20.520 --> 24:22.660
IDIOT!

24:29.190 --> 24:30.530
Eh? Kotarou-kun?!

24:31.080 --> 24:33.780
Geez... I really misjudged you.

24:34.070 --> 24:38.260
I'm sick of you worrying over old stuff.

24:38.260 --> 24:40.020
Is worrying your hobby or something?!

24:40.530 --> 24:46.170
The way you are, no matter how much power you get, you'll never catch up to the Thousand Master!

24:46.860 --> 24:47.540
What?!

24:47.930 --> 24:49.570
Of course, not even Fate.

24:49.570 --> 24:53.420
Heck, probably not even Asuna-neechan!

24:53.630 --> 24:57.460
You don't even know what you're lacking now, do you?!

24:57.990 --> 25:01.920
Because of that, you got the living daylights beaten out of you!

25:02.940 --> 25:05.130
Oh? Did I hit a nerve?

25:05.130 --> 25:08.730
If I did, what are you gonna do about it?!

25:08.730 --> 25:10.300
Huh, Negi?!

25:10.640 --> 25:13.280
I'm so frustrated I don't even have the energy to hit you!

25:13.870 --> 25:15.530
Here it comes!

25:16.320 --> 25:18.300
Rapid Air Black Wolf Fang!

25:16.320 --> 25:18.300
Shikkuu Kokurouga! {疾空黒狼牙}

25:25.230 --> 25:26.410
Magic Arrows! {Translation -Southrop}

25:25.230 --> 25:26.410
Sagitta Magica! {Latin -Southrop}

25:26.410 --> 25:27.540
Three Arrows of Thunder! {Translation -Southrop}

25:26.410 --> 25:27.540
Fulguralis! {Latin -Southrop}

25:32.360 --> 25:33.550
Haha, you're not good enough!

25:35.300 --> 25:36.550
But,

25:36.860 --> 25:40.040
Asuna-neechan has it!

25:47.660 --> 25:49.650
If you beat me, I'll tell you what it is!

25:53.180 --> 25:54.070
You...

26:00.190 --> 26:02.970
Wh-Why a fistfight all of a sudden?

26:03.630 --> 26:05.450
Is Sensei's fever alright?

26:15.260 --> 26:17.340
Haha, if you don't get serious, you'll die!

26:17.340 --> 26:20.200
Ras Tel Ma Scir Magister

26:20.200 --> 26:26.270
O, 67 Spirits of Light. Come forth and strike mine enemy! {Translation -Southrop}

26:20.200 --> 26:26.270
Septem Et Sexaginta Spiritus Lucis Coentes Inimicum Sagitent! {Latin -Southrop}

26:26.680 --> 26:28.970
Howling Burst Punch! {Translation -Southrop}

26:26.680 --> 26:28.970
Kuon Baku Saiken! {Kotarou's attack -Southrop}

26:29.130 --> 26:30.590
Cherry Blossom Crushing Fist! {Translation -Southrop}

26:29.130 --> 26:30.590
Ouka Houken! {Negi's attack -Southrop}

26:37.310 --> 26:38.110
Hey now...

26:38.110 --> 26:41.140
What kind of military training is this?

26:45.700 --> 26:48.840
Well, you seem to be feeling better now.

26:48.840 --> 26:50.410
And your fever should've gone down too, right?

26:51.520 --> 26:51.960
Huh?

26:53.720 --> 26:55.220
You're right!

26:55.220 --> 26:55.840
How?

26:56.650 --> 27:00.250
Konoka-neechan's Complete Recovery spell was too strong.

27:00.610 --> 27:04.590
Quite a lot of Magic remained in your body and wreaked havoc.

27:05.040 --> 27:09.760
The cure is simple. You just need to release the Magic in your body.

27:09.760 --> 27:11.720
Kotarou-kun... So that's why you said...

27:12.780 --> 27:13.730
Th-Thanks...

27:14.000 --> 27:15.850
No problem! Don't be so reserved!

27:17.070 --> 27:19.910
Oh yeah, Kotarou-kun, what was that you mentioned before?

27:19.910 --> 27:21.360
Something I was lacking?

27:21.360 --> 27:24.850
Huh? You didn't win, so I don't need to tell you!

27:25.130 --> 27:28.120
Well, I guess I have no choice. Consider it a freebie.

27:29.020 --> 27:31.420
Something that Asuna-neechan has but you don't have...

27:32.120 --> 27:32.750
That's...

27:33.000 --> 27:34.000
Th-That's...?

27:34.660 --> 27:37.000
Idiocy, perhaps?

27:37.700 --> 27:38.320
Idio...?

27:40.310 --> 27:42.430
Hey! I don't get it!

27:42.430 --> 27:44.930
Nope, sorry. Freebie's over!

27:44.930 --> 27:46.270
Kotarou-kun!
